# WhatsApp Customer Support Agent

## Overview
This project is a **WhatsApp-based customer support automation system** built using n8n.

The agent is capable of handling **text, voice, and image messages**, simulating a real customer support workflow used by businesses.

## Core Capabilities
- Process incoming WhatsApp text messages
- Transcribe and respond to voice messages
- Analyze images and generate contextual responses
- Route messages using internal logic
- Send automated replies back to users

## Key Features
- Multi-modal input handling (Text, Voice, Image)
- Automated response generation
- Context-aware interactions
- Clean and scalable workflow design

## Tech Stack
- n8n
- WhatsApp Cloud API
- OpenAI (Speech-to-Text, Image Understanding)

## Workflow Logic
1. Incoming WhatsApp message triggers the workflow
2. Message type is detected (text, voice, or image)
3. Relevant processing logic is applied
4. Response is sent back to the user via WhatsApp

## Use Cases
- Customer support automation
- Business WhatsApp assistants
- Message-based service systems

## Notes
- This repository contains an exported **n8n workflow (JSON)**.
- Designed to reflect real customer interaction workflows.
